[{"answer":"Well, we have this school excursion planned, but when exactly is it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Is it this Tuesday or Wednesday?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Well it can't be Tuesday, with the English tests taking place.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Ah, right. Not Tuesday, but Wednesday.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/4.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right - all day Wednesday - taking a bus outside the city.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/5.mp3"},{"answer":"And where are we going?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Ah, last month we went to Arthur Island,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/7-2021-12-21-09-47-06.mp3"},{"answer":"so this time we're going to the... Animal Park","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Arthur Island was okay, but it was too cold.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Let's hope the weather for this week's excursion is better.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/10.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't suppose animals care about bad weather, but I certainly do.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Have you heard the forecast?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, and it's not too bad.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Basically, they're saying Monday will be sunny.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Good...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/15.mp3"},{"answer":"But then the weather will change.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Not so good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, Tuesday we'll have some showers,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/18.mp3"},{"answer":"but by Wednesday, the day of our excursion, it will be...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/19.mp3"},{"answer":"well, their words are \"cold and cloudy\".","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Cold and cloudy. Well, as long as it isn't 'wet and rainy', I'm happy enough.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/21.mp3"},{"answer":"We won't need umbrellas, just warm clothing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/22.mp3"},{"answer":"And what time will we get there?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/23.mp3"},{"answer":"Let's see. The bus picks us up at 8:30 am,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/24.mp3"},{"answer":"and then it's an hour and a half on the road, so we arrive at 10 a.m...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/25.mp3"},{"answer":"sorry, with the 15-minute break, that will actually be 10:15 a.m.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/26.mp3"},{"answer":"That's early enough.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Then all our students can see the animals, have their fun, and do whatever they want to do.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, one fun event planned that day is 'Birds of Prey'.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/29.mp3"},{"answer":"What's that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/30.mp3"},{"answer":"That's when they bring out several birds of prey:","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/31.mp3"},{"answer":"eagles, falcons, kites, those sorts of birds,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/32.mp3"},{"answer":"and throw pieces of meat into the air,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/33.mp3"},{"answer":"and the birds swoop down and eat them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/34.mp3"},{"answer":"It's quite impressive.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/35.mp3"},{"answer":"Sounds great. 'Birds of Prey'.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/36.mp3"},{"answer":"Are there any other activities?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/37.mp3"},{"answer":"There's a catered lunch, at the park restaurant.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/38.mp3"},{"answer":"We've already paid for that, and in the afternoon there's...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/39.mp3"},{"answer":"well, I had a choice between the 'Reptile Display' and the 'Koala Handling'.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/40.mp3"},{"answer":"In the reptile display, the students can handle live pythons and various other snakes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Surely they'd rather hold koalas?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/42.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm sure, but the koalas can't be handled unless the weather's sunny, and given the forecast,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/43.mp3"},{"answer":"I thought it better to choose the reptile display.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Ummm, that's a shame.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/45.mp3"},{"answer":"These Asian students would love the 'Koala Handling'.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/46.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I know, but we can't control the weather.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/47.mp3"},{"answer":"And, then we get back. What time will that be?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/48.mp3"},{"answer":"We leave the park at 4:30, but then we face traffic,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/49.mp3"},{"answer":"so we won't get back until well after 6 pm.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/50.mp3"},{"answer":"It will most likely be 6:30.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/51.mp3"},{"answer":"But that's better than the last trip: we didn't get home until 8:30 that time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/52.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, that was a bit too late, wasn't it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Andrew, I understand you've been doing some research regarding the breakdown, by nationality of our student body.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/54.mp3"},{"answer":"That must've produced some interesting results.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/55.mp3"},{"answer":"You're right. I got some statistics from head office.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/56.mp3"},{"answer":"I would imagine that most of our students are either Japanese or Chinese.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/57.mp3"},{"answer":"You imagine right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/58.mp3"},{"answer":"But it's the Chinese who constitute the majority, but only just.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/59.mp3"},{"answer":"I had thought Koreans might be second,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/60.mp3"},{"answer":"but it's actually the Japanese, quite close behind.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/61.mp3"},{"answer":"It's somewhat surprising, but obviously all those Study Tours that our university markets in Japan are bringing in students.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/62.mp3"},{"answer":"What's the breakdown exactly?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/63.mp3"},{"answer":"Japanese are a quarter of the whole, which is considerable.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/64.mp3"},{"answer":"Last year they were only 16%, so that market has grown nicely.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/65.mp3"},{"answer":"Ah, the only other proportions of some weight are the Indonesians and Koreans - about the same.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/66.mp3"},{"answer":"Indonesians at 15%, and...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/67.mp3"},{"answer":"the Koreans are a little higher -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/68.mp3"},{"answer":"not like last year when they were less than 10%.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/69.mp3"},{"answer":"I thought we'd have more Indonesians than Koreans?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/70.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, as I said, they're about the same","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/71.mp3"},{"answer":"just like the Saudi and Thai student numbers, almost the same also -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/72.mp3"},{"answer":"both just under 10.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/73.mp3"},{"answer":"Which one is bigger?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/74.mp3"},{"answer":"Thai students number just a fraction more.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/75.mp3"},{"answer":"As for the other nationalities, collectively they're only 3%,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/76.mp3"},{"answer":"so it wasn't worth giving each of them a separate category.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/77.mp3"},{"answer":"I just grouped them under 'other'","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/78.mp3"},{"answer":"that's Vietnamese, South American, a couple of Russians, and so on.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/school-excursion-2021-12-21-09-39-43/79.mp3"}]
